DECLARE `o 8 r 4(2) the act` IS ONE OF `o 8 r 4(2) transmit the certificate of service to the Registrar of the State Courts`

-- src:683 | (2) Every certificate of service received by the Registrar of the Supreme Court in respect of such service must be transmitted by the Registrar of the
-- src:683 | Supreme Court to the Registrar of the State Courts.
@ref O 8 r 4(2) (src:683)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `o 8 r 4(2) the party` `o 8 r 4(2) the act`
`o 8 r 4(2) the duty` MEANS
